+The source cleanup passed formatting, Clippy with warnings denied, all
+17 then-existing real-model Rust tests, and all seven benchmark tests. Fresh-process
 64-token outputs match the executable saved before the Rust split at
 4-, 3-, and 2-bit precision. A separate 139-token prompt exercises batched
